      "content": "what do you mean by \"goblin tax\"? i've never heard that used in travel or logistics. is that a specific fee or something related to airport services?\n\nalso, can you provide a more concrete comparison of the total travel time? i need to know the rough estimates for both the Shinkansen and flights for the osaka to fukuoka leg as well, so i can give my team a clear picture.",
